      <div class="x-column x-md x-1-3"><div id="text-2" class="widget widget_text"><h4 class="h-widget">Board of Election Commissioners</h4>			<div class="textwidget"><p><i  class="x-icon x-icon-user" data-x-icon-s="&#xf007;" aria-hidden="true"></i>&nbsp;&nbsp;Michael K. Whitehead - Chairman<br />
<i  class="x-icon x-icon-user" data-x-icon-s="&#xf007;" aria-hidden="true"></i>&nbsp;&nbsp;Henry R. Carner - Secretary<br />
<i  class="x-icon x-icon-user" data-x-icon-s="&#xf007;" aria-hidden="true"></i>&nbsp;&nbsp;Colleen M. Scott - Member<br />
<i  class="x-icon x-icon-user" data-x-icon-s="&#xf007;" aria-hidden="true"></i>&nbsp;&nbsp;Lyle K. Querry - Member</p>
<hr>
<div class="h-widget">Directors</div>
<p><i  class="x-icon x-icon-user" data-x-icon-s="&#xf007;" aria-hidden="true"></i>&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href="mailto:tspencer@jcebmo.org">Tyler Spencer</a><br />
<i  class="x-icon x-icon-user" data-x-icon-s="&#xf007;" aria-hidden="true"></i>&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href="mailto:szorich@jcebmo.org">Sara Zorich</a><br />
