<i  class="x-icon x-icon-user" data-x-icon-s="&#xf007;" aria-hidden="true"></i>&nbsp;&nbsp;Robert (Bob) Murphy - Attorney</p>
</div>
		</div></div><div class="x-column x-md x-1-3"><div id="text-3" class="widget widget_text"><h4 class="h-widget">Resources of Interest</h4>			<div class="textwidget"><p><i  class="x-icon x-icon-arrows" data-x-icon-s="&#xf047;" aria-hidden="true"></i>&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>Moved? Changed Your Name?<br />
</strong><a href="https://jcebmo.org/wp-content/uploads/Jackson-Printable-PC.pdf" target="_blank"> Submit our FORM</a> to update your voter registration record.</p>
<p><i  class="x-icon x-icon-refresh" data-x-icon-s="&#xf021;" aria-hidden="true"></i>&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>Lost & Found<br />
Lose anything at the Poll?</strong> Driver's licenses, eyeglasses, clothing & more. Please call <strong>(816) 325-4600</strong> to check for your lost item.</p>
<p><i  class="x-icon x-icon-calendar" data-x-icon-s="&#xf133;" aria-hidden="true"></i>&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href="/calendars/">Election Calendars</a></p>
<p>NEW - <a href="https://jcebmo.org/election-information/election-worker-training/">Election Judge Manual</a></p>
</div>
		</div></div><div class="x-column x-md x-1-3 last"><div id="text-6" class="widget widget_text"><h4 class="h-widget">Voter Information Lookup</h4>			<div class="textwidget"><p>The <a href="/On-the-Ballot/">Voter Information Lookup</a> is available throughout our site in the right column of every secondary page on our site. Search your voter registration information and voting districts. </p>
<p>When available, view ballot and poll place information.</p>
<p>(Residents of Kansas City go to <a href="https://www.kceb.org" target="_blank"><br />
https://www.kceb.org</a>)</p>
</div>
